WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Maahri ji, what problems had brought you here?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sir, when I wasn't taking medicines on time, I felt like eating pencils.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I also felt like picking up and eating things like chalk from others.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
So who had you come here to consult?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Sir, Dr. Ka naam...

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Dr. Hooning, sir.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
And since when has the treatment been going on?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The treatment has been going on for 4 years.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
How much improvement do you feel there has been?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
A hundred percent improvement.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Do you feel the medicines have been prescribed properly?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Absolutely, the treatment has been right, and now you're better?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.000
No, there is no problem now. The treatment has been right.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
If there is any other patient, would you recommend them here?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Okay.
